          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Chattering Teeth"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(arcane, auditory, aura, emotion, enchantment, incapacitation, mental)\n\n60 feet. A clacking skull swarm emits a cacophony of chattering. A creature entering or beginning its turn within the area must succeed at a DC 29 Will save or become confused for 1 round. A creature that successfully saves is immune to that swarm's chattering teeth for 24 hours. The swarm can stop or resume this ability as a free action."
            },
            "id": "6d8a3d87-7b16-4dd4-bef7-cc2b821dd766",
