              "value": "Shrieking Scream"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(auditory, emotion, enchantment, fear, mental)\n\nThe clacking skull swarm emits a terrifying, painful scream that deals 10d6 sonic damage to all creatures in a 30-foot cone (DC 29 basic Will save). A creature that fails this save is also frightened 1 (frightened 2 on a critical failure). The swarm can't use Frightening Scream again for 1d4 rounds."
